{"articles":"<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__card\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"../making-every-graduate-employable/index.html\" tabindex=\"-1\" ><div class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"../wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1644773251664-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Making Every Graduate Employable\" /></div></a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"../making-every-graduate-employable/index.html\" >\n\t\t\t\tMaking Every Graduate Employable\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>As many of you know, we are into educating and empowering job seekers into confident, committed and add value to self, family and employer through the skills they acquired in our mentoring process. We use to transform 100 to 150 individuals in a year from the inception of Aroha. </p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__read-more-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"../making-every-graduate-employable/index.html\" aria-label=\"Read more about Making Every Graduate Employable\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More »\t\t</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__meta-data\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-post-date\">\n\t\t\tSeptember 20, 2024\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__card\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"../why-is-data-engineering-a-promising-career-choice/index.html\" tabindex=\"-1\" ><div class