W implementations\" /></div></a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"../ways-of-calculating-roi-from-bidw-implementations/index.html\" >\n\t\t\t\tWays of calculating ROI from BIDW implementations\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>Most of us read that, about 75% of implementations don&#8217;t give the ROI in BIDW related projects. When I first started to work in BIDW projects, I used to wonder why management / team is not able to prove the ROI. After being in this area for a while, its very evident that wh</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__read-more-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"../ways-of-calculating-roi-from-bidw-implementations/index.html\" aria-label=\"Read more about Ways of calculating ROI from BIDW implementations\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More »\t\t</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__meta-data\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-post-date\">\n\t\t\tJune 22, 2024\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__card\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"../implementation-of-analytics-in-stages/index.html\" tabindex=\"-1\" ><div class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"../wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2150461313-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Implementation of Analytics in Stages\" /></div></a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"../implementation-of-analytics-in-stages/index.html\" >\n\t\t\t\tImplementation of Analytics in Stages\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ele